[V11.1a] NOTE: Reading the table: beta errors stay below tol, but provider effects can be far from converged. The likelihood criteria are relative to |l|, which grows with n, so a large fit can stop while individual providers still move; the size of the gap depends on the data (it is not monotone in n here)
